{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"card":1,"entry":2,"missions":33,"alongside":38,"kin":43,"engines":68,"usedOn":69,"sites":70,"crewed":76,"museums":77,"hero":78},null,{"id":3,"name":4,"category":5,"agency":6,"country":7,"manufacturer":8,"first_flight":9,"status":10,"era":11,"epoch":12,"best_known_for":13,"credit":14,"links":15,"linked_missions":28,"linked_sites":29,"tagline":13,"description":32},"perseverance","Perseverance（Mars 2020）","rover","NASA","USA","NASA JPL","2021-02-18","ACTIVE","2011-now","commercial-era","携带Ingenuity直升机；火星样品封存","Skeleton entry for /fleet (PRD-012 v0.2 / Phase A scaffold). Builder + agency + first-flight per public sources. Specs and gallery TBD in later phases.",[16,20,24],{"l":17,"u":18,"t":19},"Perseverance (rover) — Wikipedia","https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Perseverance_(rover)","intro",{"l":21,"u":22,"t":23},"Mars 2020 — NASA JPL","https://mars.nasa.gov/mars2020/","core",{"l":25,"u":26,"t":27},"Mars 2020 Press Kit (NASA)","https://www.jpl.nasa.gov/news/press_kits/mars_2020/launch/","deep",[3],[30],{"type":31,"site_id":3},"mars","NASA的样品封存漫游车，自2021年2月起在火星上工作。携带了首架地外直升机Ingenuity；已采集43个样品管中的33个，供日后送回地球。在耶泽罗撞击坑的古老三角洲寻找生物标志。",[34],{"id":3,"name":35,"first":36,"year":37},"Perseverance","首架在另一颗行星上飞行的直升机（Ingenuity）；首次在火星上缓存样本",2020,[39],{"id":40,"name":41,"tagline":42},"atlas-v","Atlas V","United Launch Alliance的改进型Atlas",[44,48,52,56,60,64],{"id":45,"name":46,"tagline":47},"curiosity","Curiosity (MSL)","核动力火星科学实验室火星车",{"id":49,"name":50,"tagline":51},"opportunity","Opportunity (MER-B)","Spirit的孪生探测器；在火星上运行近15年",{"id":53,"name":54,"tagline":55},"spirit","Spirit (MER-A)","火星探测漫游车;运作6年",{"id":57,"name":58,"tagline":59},"sojourner","Sojourner","火星漫游车；Pathfinder任务",{"id":61,"name":62,"tagline":63},"lrv-apollo","月球车","首次载人月球车；Apollo 15、16、17",{"id":65,"name":66,"tagline":67},"promise","PROMISE","NASA 为月球南极拟议的月球车",[],[],[71],{"type":31,"href":72,"name":73,"place":74,"text":75},"/mars/perseverance","Perseverance + Ingenuity","耶泽罗撞击坑底部","为未来火星样品返回任务设计，用于缓存有前景的岩心。截至2024年中期，已钻取并密封26多个样品。Ingenuity直升机原本计划进行为期30天的技术演示，但在2024年1月旋翼受损前共飞行72次。这是另一个世界上首次动力控制飞行。",[],[],"/orrery/images/fleet-galleries/perseverance/04.webp"],"uses":{"params":["id"]}}]}
